  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the curve for which the slope of the tangent at any point is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is (where, <math><mi>c</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant)",
